1
00:00:00,567 --> 00:00:02,697
(Leonard:)Oh, careful.

2
00:00:03,069 --> 00:00:05,739
(Leonard:)That's my original series
Battlestar Galactica flight suit.

3
00:00:06,948 --> 00:00:09,078
(Penny:)Oh, why didn't you wear it
on Halloween?

4
00:00:09,242 --> 00:00:12,332
(Leonard:)Because it's not a costume.
It's a flight suit.

5
00:00:14,873 --> 00:00:16,833
Okay, all right. Moving on.

6
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,170
(Penny:)Oh, wow, a paisley shirt.

7
00:00:19,336 --> 00:00:21,166
(Leonard:)Uh-huh, it goes with my corduroy suit.

8
00:00:22,380 --> 00:00:26,340
(Penny:)If you mean it should end up
in the same place, then I agree.

9
00:00:26,760 --> 00:00:29,180
Is this your only tie?

10
00:00:29,346 --> 00:00:31,136
(Leonard:)Ah, technically, yes.

11
00:00:31,306 --> 00:00:35,936
(Leonard:)But if you'll notice, it's reversible.

12
00:00:37,521 --> 00:00:38,901
(Leonard:)So it works as two.

13
00:00:39,356 --> 00:00:41,686
(Penny:)Oh, sweetie,
I don't even think it works as one.

14
00:00:43,610 --> 00:00:47,070
(Penny:)- Is this all your clothes?
- Yup, everything since the eighth grade.

15
00:00:47,781 --> 00:00:49,241
(Penny:)The eighth grade?

16
00:00:49,407 --> 00:00:51,197
(Leonard:)My last growth spurt.

17
00:00:52,994 --> 00:00:55,624
(Penny:)Okay, well,
guess we're back to the corduroy suit.

18
00:00:55,789 --> 00:00:59,019
- Great.
- Yup.

